title: Don't show me the shape of what I may not see.
pid: d7eb68c1-026f-4620-8ba3-ea0371ee8845
body: |2-
  Jeff's change to "music" was four new children, all in skgrepos I cannot read. To me it is four headlines reading "Reference to unknown node.", each carrying the hidden note's ID. That tells me there is something private there and how much, and nothing more. His mailbox "from Ed" shows me nothing else.
